{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC21-S014","speaker":"Narrator","text":"October. November. December.","known_audio_id_before":"8f3196e2-0ca5-4ea4-be0d-c80c257db48f","at":"2026-08-27T20:37:39.568Z","known_audio_id_after":"6c0f0f90-df4c-4b5f-966f-eff805932754","reused":false,"bytes":37440,"duration_ms":3072,"veracity":"not_sampled","status":"swapped"}
{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S002","speaker":"Friend","text":"Of course, no problem. You seem to speak it very well. I can understand you easily.","known_audio_id_before":"bf71a2b8-0cd5-4780-8664-c45652aa9b43","at":"2026-08-27T20:37:41.693Z","known_audio_id_after":"da23d746-7feb-4d60-91be-6f6a14a8807a","reused":false,"bytes":67680,"duration_ms":5592,"veracity":"not_sampled","status":"swapped"}
{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S004","speaker":"Friend","text":"Am I speaking slowly enough for you now?","known_audio_id_before":"86b7cbd7-e0a2-4524-a29a-8c4240a9fbb2","at":"2026-08-27T20:37:44.509Z","known_audio_id_after":"2bf2685f-bdca-4443-94a0-1cc2b2600e54","reused":false,"bytes":30240,"duration_ms":2472,"veracity":"not_sampled","status":"swapped"}
{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S006","speaker":"Friend","text":"I think you're doing very well. I'm impressed. I think you're ready to start speaking Spanish to anyone who speaks Spanish.","known_audio_id_before":"60117837-92f0-4c3b-8485-16c2bec0ec22","at":"2026-08-27T20:37:46.477Z","known_audio_id_after":"87e1279d-f3c5-4203-9cfc-92eda49872c8","reused":false,"bytes":91584,"duration_ms":7584,"veracity":"not_sampled","status":"swapped"}
{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S008","speaker":"Friend","text":"You should be confident already. I think you're doing much better than you realise. I feel comfortable speaking with you, and I'm not talking very slowly.","known_audio_id_before":"d83427f8-3263-42bc-9814-418c8839ec2e","at":"2026-08-27T20:37:49.685Z","known_audio_id_after":"d6665613-a638-4136-8734-4edf11d0e960","reused":false,"bytes":91008,"duration_ms":7536,"veracity":"not_sampled","status":"swapped"}
{"slot":"spa_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S010","speaker":"Friend","text":"I think that's normal. Learning a new language is difficult. But it's so much fun when you start to have conversations, isn't it?","known_audio_id_before":"55b29abc-7637-4ea9-8a00-29302f799665","at":"2026-08-27T20:37:53.006Z","known_audio_id_after":"714ba13e-d273-49c0-a8c4-82fef148cebf","reused":false,"bytes":91008,"duration_ms":7536,"veracity":"not_sampled","status":"swapped"}
